{"overview":"مرلین، پسر جاودان بارد تالیسین و شاهزاده‌دختر آتلانتیس چاریس، داستان رشد تراژیک، سقوط به دیوانگی و ناپدید شدن شگفت‌انگیزش را دنبال می‌کند؛ افسانه‌ای که پیرامون او شکل می‌گیرد. پیش از تولد شاه آرثر، مرلین که یا مرده یا افسانه‌ای محسوب می‌شود، در بریتانیای زیر‑رومی ظاهر می‌شود تا پادشاهی‌های پاره‑پاره را در برابر تهدید ساکسون‌ها متحد کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Merlin, the immortal son of the bard Taliesin and Atlantean Princess Charis, is followed through his tragic upbringing, descent into madness, and shocking disappearance, leading to the legend that surrounds him. Set before King Arthur's birth, Merlin, assumed dead or a myth, reemerges in sub-Roman Britain to unite the fractured kingdoms under threat from Saxon invaders.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":25,"y":2023,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":7,"y":2026,"poster":"/wXfTsO7pqAqo94f0AHaas9rjBNh.jpg"}],"episodes":7,"crew":["Jeremy Boreing"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["HU","US"],"cast":[{"name":"Tom Sharp","role":"Merlin","photo":"/mqH0Wnm2SP5d2kXjdD55X5beRX4.jpg"},{"name":"Rose Reid","role":"Charis","photo":"/mtYxHu4GC3Imdf0jwF5OOy8Sv0T.jpg"}],"trailer":"RkmT-kZIHNU","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/235685-the-pendragon-cycle-rise-of-the-merlin/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/235685-the-pendragon-cycle-rise-of-the-merlin/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"}]},"CA":{"link":